1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,880
And now it's the old scout master.

2
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:15,760
So one of my scouts told me that it was difficult for my generation to understand his world.

3
00:00:15,760 --> 00:00:18,680
You were up in a different world. he said. you know, there's there's more computing

4
00:00:18,680 --> 00:00:23,940
power in my cell phone than the biggest computer in the world had when you were my age.

5
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:28,800
We have the internet and ways to communicate you could only dream of.

6
00:00:29,240 --> 00:00:30,720
I looked at him and I said: you know, you're right,

7
00:00:30,720 --> 00:00:33,320
We didn't have them and we did dream of them,

8
00:00:33,920 --> 00:00:37,040
And then we invented them for you and you're welcome.

9
00:00:39,720 --> 00:00:43,040
Oh well, hey, this is podcast number 141..

10
00:00:58,800 --> 00:01:17,200
So welcome back to the scout master podcast.

11
