00:16:50,960 --> 00:16:55,720
he must, MUST, must be allowed to be evaluated

280
00:16:55,720 --> 00:16:58,600
under an alternative method that considers

281
00:16:58,600 --> 00:17:02,000
the activities outside his unit and outside of scouting.

282
00:17:02,000 --> 00:17:03,760
That's a policy statement

283
00:17:03,760 --> 00:17:05,960
and there's no getting away from it.

284
00:17:05,960 --> 00:17:08,160
So if you're a troop, you've established

285
00:17:08,160 --> 00:17:10,720
a metric standard about being active

286
00:17:10,720 --> 00:17:12,319
and a scout doesn't meet that,

287
00:17:12,319 --> 00:17:15,480
then the next thing that you do is you talk with the scout

288
00:17:15,480 --> 00:17:17,360
and you ask him what he's doing outside of scouting.

289
00:17:17,360 --> 00:17:18,599
that's kept him away.

290
00:17:18,599 --> 00:17:20,599
The thing that scouting wants to do

291
00:17:20,599 --> 00:17:23,960
is not totally monopolize a boy's time

292
00:17:23,960 --> 00:17:26,760
so they can't be involved in anything else

