00:17:30,120 --> 00:17:32,840
only to what he's doing in scouting.

295
00:17:32,840 --> 00:17:36,560
We want him to be an active member of his community.

296
00:17:36,560 --> 00:17:38,920
We want him to be an active member of his school

297
00:17:38,920 --> 00:17:42,560
and his family and his religious institution.

298
00:17:42,560 --> 00:17:45,720
I mean, come on, that's what we want.

299
00:17:45,720 --> 00:17:47,760
So scouting does not begin and end

300
00:17:47,760 --> 00:17:49,720
at the threshold of the troop meeting room

301
00:17:49,720 --> 00:17:51,640
or the gateway to the campsite.

302
00:17:51,640 --> 00:17:53,680
It's in the community

303
00:17:53,680 --> 00:17:55,520
And these are not things that

304
00:17:55,520 --> 00:17:56,960
well, we'll just consider this

305
00:17:56,960 --> 00:17:59,400
because we don't want to make the boy upset or anything.

306
00:17:59,400 --> 00:18:02,639
No, this is real achievement.

307
00:18:02,639 --> 00:18:06,200
He is out there living the scout oath and law

308
00:18:06,200 --> 00:18:08,680
and expressing that in the things

309
00:18:08,680 --> 00:18:10,960
that he is doing in the community,

310
00:18:10,960 --> 00:18:13,840
And so we consider that

311
00:18:13,840 --> 00:18:15,120
It's fair.

312
00:18:15,120 --> 00:18:17,200
It's what we do for scouts.

313
00:18:17,200 --> 00:18:21,160
For the 30-some years that I've been around scouting,

314
00:18:21,160 --> 00:18:25,120
I get tired of people carrying on about older scouts

315
00:18:25,200 --> 00:18:29,720
and how we have to do all this crazy stuff

316
00:18:29,720 --> 00:18:30,960
to keep older scouts around.

317
00:18:30,960 --> 00:18:33,000
We have to have these special programs

318
00:18:33,000 --> 00:18:35,120
and blah, blah, blah, blah, blah.

319
00:18:35,120 --> 00:18:38,640
and somebody coined the whole fumes thing

320
00:18:38,640 --> 00:18:39,560
years and years ago.

321
00:18:39,560 --> 00:18:40,920
And if you haven't heard that

322
00:18:40,920 --> 00:18:42,640
when a scout turns 15 or 16,

323
00:18:42,640 --> 00:18:45,640
you lose them to the fumes, perfumes and car fumes

324
00:18:45,640 --> 00:18:47,040
and whatever I don't know.

325
00:18:47,040 --> 00:18:48,120
I've never liked that

326
00:18:49,160 --> 00:18:50,960
because it's simply not true.

327
00:18:50,960 --> 00:18:53,760
if you present the scout program,

328
00:18:53,760 --> 00:18:57,240
So if he has real responsibilities leading his troop

329
00:18:57,240 --> 00:18:59,720
and he is engaged and involved in that,

330
00:18:59,720 --> 00:19:01,280
he's gonna stay interested.

331
00:19:01,280 --> 00:19:02,360
And the other thing is

332
00:19:02,360 --> 00:19:04,320
is that you can't build a fence around him

333
00:19:04,320 --> 00:19:08,280
and say all you do is what you do with your troop.

334
00:19:08,280 --> 00:19:09,840
He's going to do sports,

335
00:19:09,840 --> 00:19:12,800
He's going to be in six different clubs after school.

336
00:19:12,800 --> 00:19:15,200
He's going to be in his church youth group.

337
00:19:15,200 --> 00:19:20,200
We see those not as being competing with scouting.

338
00:19:20,880 --> 00:19:22,880
Actually, we see it as an expression

339
00:19:22,880 --> 00:19:27,080
of the scout oath and law at work in a young man's life.

340
00:19:27,080 --> 00:19:28,440
Here's a 15-year-old boy

341
00:19:28,440 --> 00:19:30,040
who's out actively playing soccer

342
00:19:30,040 --> 00:19:32,440
and he's really interested in that, okay.

343
00:19:32,440 --> 00:19:34,040
And like 15-year-old boys,

344
00:19:34,040 --> 00:19:37,440
they get on a tear about soccer or football or basketball.

345
00:19:37,440 --> 00:19:39,920
It's the most important thing in the world to them.

346
00:19:39,920 --> 00:19:43,560
That may last for a month or a couple of years,

347
00:19:43,560 --> 00:19:45,320
or it may last for a lifetime

348
00:19:45,320 --> 00:19:46,760
and more power to them.

349
00:19:46,760 --> 00:19:47,920
That's great.

350
00:19:47,920 --> 00:19:49,360
So what do you want?

351
00:19:49,360 --> 00:19:53,360
Do you want scouting to be all or nothing for those boys,

352
00:19:53,360 --> 00:19:55,720
Or do you want scouting to be a part of their lives?

353
00:19:55,720 --> 00:19:57,760
When we present the program properly,

354
00:19:57,760 --> 00:20:00,640
when we administer the advancement program properly.

355
00:20:00,640 --> 00:20:05,600
we are letting scouting be a part of their lives. okay,

